# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for MsQuic (D427). tools/build_quic.sh builds
# it as a Release library without ThreadSanitizer, so the atomics its
# bindings order their teardown by are invisible: a binding's lock destroyed
# after its worker last took it reads as a race though the worker's
# reference was released first. It is MsQuic's to check.
race:QuicBindingUninitialize
